// Reviewer correction (round 1): originally authored as Explosion, which
// always detonates centered on the caster (no target-point field exists)
// -- contradicted this spell's own longer cast range. Converted to
// GroundAoe, the real detonate-at-a-chosen-point primitive.
// Reviewer correction (round 2): damage/poise still carried the old
// Explosion-tier numbers (55/15) after the round-1 conversion, a ~25%
// premium over this circle's real GroundAoe baseline
// (sickening_radiance.ron/spellfire_storm.ron/storm_sphere.ron, 44/10) --
// that premium exists to compensate Explosion's self-centered delivery
// risk, which this spell no longer takes as a ranged GroundAoe. Matched
// to the circle-4 GroundAoe baseline. Sheet's save-for-half rider
// dropped, no partial-damage-on-save primitive exists.
GroundAoe(
    energy_cost: 105.0,
    buildup_duration: 0.7,
    delay: 0.4,
    max_range: 91.0,
    recover_duration: 0.5,
    damage: 44,
    poise: 10,
    knockback: (direction: Away, strength: 5.0),
    radius: 6,
    min_falloff: 0.35,
    dodgeable: Roll,
    rooted_cast: false,
    reagent: Some(Blue),
    meta: (
        school: Some(Evocation),
        source: Some(Arcane),
        // level 4 spell -> min_level 24, the level * 6 convention.
        requirements: (min_level: Some(24)),
    ),
)
